oduct detail view.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Tagging functionality (comma-separated tags field in admin form) works correctly; tags saved and displayed on product detail page.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Marking a product as Featured via toggle switch in admin form correctly surfaces it in the homepage Featured section.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Navigating to /category/tech via SPA link shows correct heading \\\"Tech Gadgets\\\", category combobox pre-set to \\\"Tech Gadgets\\\", and exactly the 3 tech products (Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra, MacBook Pro 14, Sony WH-1000XM5). Category counts on homepage (3/3/3) match.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On /products page, every product card displays name, category badge, price, star rating value, brief description, product image, and a \\\"Buy Now\\\" purchase action link for all 9 seeded products.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-10\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Price range minimum filter does not correctly filter results\", \"actual\": \"Sort by Newest and Top Rated work correctly (Top Rated correctly ordered products descending by rating: 4.9,4.8,4.7,4.7,4.6,4.6,4.5,4.5,4.4). Minimum Rating filter (e.g. \\\"4.5+ stars\\\") correctly excludes lower-rated products. However, the Price Range minimum slider is broken: after raising the minimum to $610 via keyboard (slider showed \\\"$610\\\" to \\\"$2495\\\"), the result set still included Bowflex SelectTech 552 ($549) and Theragun Pro ($599), both priced below the $610 minimum threshold - only one product (Sony WH-1000XM5, $399) was actually excluded when count dropped from 8 to 7, indicating the price filter does not properly apply the minimum threshold to all products.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No persistence across page reload\", \"actual\": \"Created/edited products exist only in in-memory React state. After a full page reload/revisit (browser_navigate causing full reload) of admin panel or public pages, newly created/edited products disappeared entirely - changes are not persisted to any backend/storage.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Category is a single-select field (one combobox, not multi-select) in the admin form; each product displays exactly one category badge (e.g., \\\"Tech\\\") on all views. Category counts on homepage (Tech 3, Home 3, Fitness 3) sum to exactly 9 total products with no overlap, confirming each product belongs to exactly one category.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Selected two tags (coffee, vacuum) simultaneously in Filters panel; result showed 2 products (Breville Barista Express with coffee/espresso/kitchen tags, Dyson V15 Detect with vacuum/cordless/cleaning tags), confirming OR logic - each result matches at least one selected tag.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking \\\"Create Product\\\" with all fields left blank (Name, Image URL, Affiliate Link, Short Description, no spec filled) did not create a product; a toast notification \\\"Please fill in all required fields\\\" appeared, the form remained open, and the product list still showed only the original 9 products - confirming publish validation blocks incomplete submissions.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-22\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Navigating to /category/invalid-category-xyz displays a clear \\\"Category Not Found\\\" heading with message \\\"The category you're looking for doesn't exist.\\\" instead of an error or blank page.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Filtering and searching update results instantly client-side without requiring page reload (confirmed via keyword search and tag filter interactions).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Sort dropdown (custom combobox) correctly reorders product list immediately upon selecting an option (e.g., Price: Low to High) without page reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Product detail page \\\"Buy Now\\\" button has correct href (https://example.com/sony-xm5) matching the affiliate link entered for the product, pointing to an external retailer domain.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On /products page, selecting \\\"Fitness\\\" in the category combobox instantly updated the displayed products (3 products found: Bowflex, Theragun, Peloton) and combobox label updated to \\\"Fitness\\\" without page reload, confirming category filter selection updates active category state and displayed products.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Homepage \\\"Editor's Top Picks\\\" (Featured) section displays only products with Featured=true; when a product's Featured flag was toggled off via admin, it was immediately removed from the homepage Featured section, confirming featured content accuracy.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Product tags shown on detail page (headphones, wireless, noise-cancelling, premium) match tags used in the Filters panel and are relevant to the product; category assignment is consistent between category browsing pages and the product's own detail page across all 9 seeded products checked during category/tag filte